                                "sense_id": "6d8c9967-8262-3048-948d-2146f3113584",
                                "text": "But the whole circumstances of the Latrocinium, where everything was done to degrade Constantinople by Dioscurus, render it impossible to attach any weight to a statement of this kind ..."
